          },
          "create_time": 1776686400.0,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "I run a booking app for mobile pet groomers and about 18 % of appointments are no-shows. Should I ask for a deposit at booking time? canary-chatgpt-01"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "d-a1": {
        "id": "d-a1",
        "parent": "d-u1",
        "children": [
          "d-u2"
        ],
        "message": {
          "id": "d-a1",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1776686430.0,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Yes, a small deposit is the usual fix. Start with a percentage of the service price, charge it when the booking is made, and credit it against the final bill so it never feels like an extra fee."
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "d-u2": {
        "id": "d-u2",
        "parent": "d-a1",
        "children": [
          "d-a2"
        ],
        "message": {
          "id": "d-u2",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1776686520.0,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "We tried 25 % on new customers only. After six weeks no-shows fell from 18 % to 4 %, and repeat customers never noticed. Is that a normal result or did I get lucky?"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "d-a2": {
        "id": "d-a2",
        "parent": "d-u2",
        "children": [
          "d-u3"
        ],
        "message": {
          "id": "d-a2",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1776686550.0,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "That is a strong result but not an unusual one. A deposit changes the cost of forgetting, and new customers are the group with the least commitment, so they respond most."
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "d-u3": {
        "id": "d-u3",
        "parent": "d-a2",
        "children": [
          "d-a3"
        ],
        "message": {
          "id": "d-u3",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1776686640.0,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Should the deposit be refundable if the groomer cancels or the customer gives more than a day of notice? I do not want to create support tickets."
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "d-a3": {
        "id": "d-a3",
        "parent": "d-u3",
        "children": [
          "d-u4"
        ],
        "message": {
          "id": "d-a3",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1776686670.0,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Refund automatically in both cases. It costs you nothing in trust and it removes the single biggest source of disputes."
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "d-u4": {
        "id": "d-u4",
        "parent": "d-a3",
        "children": [
          "d-a4"
        ],
        "message": {
          "id": "d-u4",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1776686700.0,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "thanks!"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "d-a4": {
        "id": "d-a4",
        "parent": "d-u4",
        "children": [],
        "message": {
          "id": "d-a4",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1776686730.0,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Any time."
            ]
          }
        }
      },
