          "create_time": 1779894000.0,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "A groomer signed up on Monday, took a payment on Tuesday, and emailed me on Thursday saying I had stolen her money. How long does Stripe Connect Express really hold the first payout? canary-chatgpt-02"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "p-a1": {
        "id": "p-a1",
        "parent": "p-u1",
        "children": [
          "p-u2"
        ],
        "message": {
          "id": "p-a1",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1779894030.0,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Stripe Connect Express holds the first payout for a new account while it verifies the business. Plan for about seven days before the first transfer arrives, and tell the groomer up front. During that window the balance is visible in the dashboard but cannot be withdrawn. The safest pattern is to show a banner in the onboarding flow that explains the delay in plain words, then send an email on the day the payout becomes available. The safest pattern is to show a banner in the onboarding flow that explains the delay in plain words, then send an email on the day the payout becomes available. The safest pattern is to show a banner in the onboarding flow that explains the delay in plain words, then send an email on the day the payout becomes available. PAST-THE-CUT the assistant reply continues beyond the six hundred character limit and this marker must never appear in the imported memory."
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "p-u2": {
        "id": "p-u2",
        "parent": "p-a1",
        "children": [
          "p-a2"
        ],
        "message": {
          "id": "p-u2",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1779894200.0,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Then I should warn groomers before they sign up, not after. Where is the best place to put that warning so they read it and do not think they were robbed?"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "p-a2": {
        "id": "p-a2",
        "parent": "p-u2",
        "children": [],
        "message": {
          "id": "p-a2",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1779894230.0,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Put it on the pricing page and again on the Stripe step of onboarding, in one sentence, with the number of days."
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
